# Rust build output
target/

# Local editor and OS files
.DS_Store

# Per-run agent working state: gathered copies of other repositories' files,
# hydrated campaign specs, reports, and the task briefs handed to delegated
# workers. None of it is source. A committed gather copy makes this repository's
# code search answer with another repository's details, and a worker brief is
# already summarized by the commit it produced.
#
# The two config files beside this directory are NOT ignored on purpose:
# .cortexkit/alfonso.jsonc (renamed .cortexkit/prefrontal.jsonc) chooses where
# this repository's delegated workers run, and .cortexkit/WORKER.md is the
# instruction file every one of them receives. Both change how work is done
# here, so they are reviewed and versioned like any other config. The scratch
# directory is listed under both names while the rename from alfonso to
# prefrontal rolls out.
.cortexkit/alfonso/
.cortexkit/prefrontal/
.cortexkit/magic-context/
